----- E-COMMERCE SALES ANALYSIS USING ORACLE SQL -----

--- Project Overview
This project analyzes e-commerce data using Oracle SQL.This is my first SQL portfolio project.I used Oracle SQL to analyze
sample e-commerce data and answer business-related questions about customers,products,orders,and sales revenue.

-- Database Tabels
1.Customers
2.Products
3.Orders
4.Order_items

--- SQL Concepts used
Select and Where
Order by
Group by
Aggregate Functions
Joins

-- Tools Used
1.Oracle Live SQL
2.Visual Studio Code

-- Learning Outcome
Through this project,I practiced writing SQL queries,connecting related tables using JOINs,summarizing data using aggregate functions,
and answering basic business questions.

-- Author
SQL Portfolio Project - Beginner Level
